n  /// \"CREATE_SETTLEMENT\", \"CREATE_PAYMENT\") — free-form for now.\n  operation String\n\n  /// Reference to the stored response for this operation, so a retried\n  /// request with the same key can be answered without re-executing it.\n  /// Exact shape (e.g. a JSON blob vs. a pointer to another table) is left\n  /// to the backend implementation.\n  responseRef String?\n\n  createdAt DateTime @default(now())\n  expiresAt DateTime\n\n  @@unique([userId, key])\n  @@map(\"idempotency_keys\")\n}\n",
